usage: signal-ingest replay --bundles <dir> --from <RFC3339> --to <RFC3339> [--tenant t] --out <file>

Re-evaluates stored observations through the same stage 1 and stage 2 code the
live sink runs, with the clock replaced by observation timestamps, and writes the
canonical finding and decision projection. See
docs/signalloom/runbooks/slaws-policy-replay.md

  -bundles string
    	directory of policy bundles to replay with (default "/etc/policy-engine/bundles")
  -from string
    	start of the observation range, RFC3339 (required)
  -out string
    	write canonical findings and decisions here (required)
  -tenant string
    	restrict the replay to one tenant
  -to string
    	end of the observation range, RFC3339 (required)
